{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2023-02-09 08:04:00', 'title': '98% OF ENTERPRISES USING PUBLIC CLOUD HAVE ADOPTED A MULTICLOUD INFRASTRUCTURE PROVIDER STRATEGY', 'text': 'NEW RESEARCH FOUND THAT IT LEADERS USE MULTIPLE CLOUD PROVIDERS TO BENEFIT FROM REDUCED COSTS AND MORE CONTROL OVER THEIR DATA AUSTIN, TEXAS , FEB. 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MULTICLOUD IS THE NEW REALITY IN ENTERPRISE TECHNOLOGY ACCORDING TO A STUDY FROM 451 RESEARCH, PART OF S&P GLOBAL MARKET INTELLIGENCE, COMMISSIONED BY ORACLE CLOUD INFRASTRUCTURE. THE STUDY COLLECTED INFORMATION FROM 1,500 RESPONDENTS AT ENTERPRISES—ORGANIZATIONS WITH MORE THAN 1,000 FULL-TIME EMPLOYEES IN NORTH AMERICA OR MORE THAN 500 IN OTHER REGIONS—ABOUT HOW THEY USE THE CLOUD WITHIN THEIR ORGANIZATION AND FOUND THAT ALMOST EVERY CLOUD JOURNEY IS NOW BECOMING A MULTICLOUD JOURNEY.'}